Subject: [PATCH 01/16] Clear glass backdrop, Immersive transparency, touchpad
 swipe and one-tap view cycle

- Clear glass material: see-through window with glass opacity and cover glow sliders
- Immersive view goes transparent and hides the main window underneath
- Coverflow: sideways touchpad swipe, preload up-next covers
- Tap the album cover to cycle Blueprint -> Lyrics -> Coverflow

